# WENDY Project: Business Plan v0.1
**Entity:** Splippers.com Ltd
**Date:** 2026-05-04
**Status:** Live
**Overhead:** £27.75/month | **Stack:** Cursor + Google Workspace + GitHub

## 1. Executive Summary
WENDY is Splippers.com’s skunkworks program to turn public-sector IT pain into books, software, and tools. No staff, no funding, no deadlines. First product: FOG Doctor — a diagnostic CLI for FOG Project multicast imaging failures.

**Model:** Free open-source tool → £9 ebook → £49 software pack → £199 remote rescue.
**Target:** 32,000 UK schools. 8,000 actively use FOG/Clonezilla.
**Year 1 Goal:** £5,300 revenue on £336 cost.

## 2. Problem Statement
UK school IT teams lose 6-15hrs per site re-imaging device batches. FOG Project is free but multicast fails silently. Common causes: IGMP snooping, NIC binding, dead FOGMulticastManager, mis-tuned udp-sender. No commercial support exists. Each failed imaging day costs £300+ in staff time. Current fix = 2008-era forum posts.

