## 6. Risk & Mitigation
| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
| --- | --- | --- |
| EA NI conflict of interest | Legal/HR | No on-site work, no EA IP, LTD separation, out-of-hours only |
| FOG Project EOL | Product relevance | FOG Doctor diagnostics apply to Clonezilla/MDT. Pivot if needed |
| Founder time | Slow shipping | Cursor generates 80% of code/docs. Ship v1 ugly, iterate live |
| Support burden | Scales badly | Free tier = community GitHub Issues. Paid tiers only get email |

